  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cce81dcd78b32554",
      "translationZh": "今年早些时候，我们宣布与 Amazon 达成战略合作，让企业更轻松地在 Amazon SageMaker 中使用 Hugging Face，更快交付前沿的机器学习功能。我们推出了全新的 Hugging Face 深度学习容器（DLC），用于在 Amazon SageMaker 中训练 Hugging Face Transformer 模型。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "848f9f74de37f08d",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们很高兴与大家分享一个新的推理方案，让在 Amazon SageMaker 上部署 Hugging Face Transformers 变得前所未有地简单！借助新的 Hugging Face 推理 DLC，你只需多写一行代码就能部署训练好的模型进行推理，或从 Model Hub 中任选 10,000 多个公开模型之一，直接部署到 Amazon SageMaker。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11dfdd5e5e0c7a05",
      "translationZh": "在 SageMaker 中部署模型，你会获得可随时投入生产的端点：它在你的 AWS 环境中轻松扩缩，内置监控，还带一大堆企业级功能。这是一次非常愉快的合作，希望你能好好利用它！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28150114fe81e6f4",
      "translationZh": "下面介绍如何使用新的 SageMaker Hugging Face Inference Toolkit 部署基于 Transformers 的模型：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e2cdb1465a2db46",
      "translationZh": "搞定！🚀",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93ec4857efb44304",
      "translationZh": "要了解如何通过 Amazon SageMaker Python SDK 访问和使用新的 Hugging Face DLC，请查看下面的指南与资源。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e4e5914565600428",
      "translationZh": "资源、文档与示例 📄",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78c4c6fdd8c17122",
      "translationZh": "下面是把你自己的模型部署到 Amazon SageMaker 所需的全部重要资源。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6a07fe108da17686",
