      "translationZh": "把模型部署到 Amazon SageMaker",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e8e4e02d709ca4c7",
      "translationZh": "面向 Hugging Face 的 Amazon SageMaker 文档",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c9df8924469ec596",
      "translationZh": "面向 Hugging Face 的 SageMaker Python SDK 文档",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "83acecdd1cd68a89",
      "translationZh": "深度学习容器（Deep Learning Container）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "263e89bd0a408afb",
      "translationZh": "Notebook：把 10,000 多个 Hugging Face Transformers 之一部署到 Amazon SageMaker 进行推理",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "743c5b47acb210cc",
      "translationZh": "Notebook：把 Hugging Face Transformer 模型从 S3 部署到 SageMaker 进行推理",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5bbc85746c016208",
      "translationZh": "SageMaker Hugging Face Inference Toolkit ⚙️",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0920f3d8c4a4b66d",
      "translationZh": "除了为推理优化的 Hugging Face Transformers 深度学习容器，我们还为 Amazon SageMaker 打造了一个全新的 Inference Toolkit。这个新的推理工具包借助 transformers 库的 pipelines，实现零代码部署——无需为预处理或后处理编写任何代码。在下方“入门”一节中，你可以看到两个把模型部署到 Amazon SageMaker 的示例。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08c7bee7faca3d18",
      "translationZh": "除了零代码部署，Inference Toolkit 还支持“自带代码”方式，你可以覆盖默认方法。关于“自带代码”的更多信息见此处的文档，或参考示例 Notebook“deploy custom inference code to Amazon SageMaker”。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b20d5b75887a53ef",
      "translationZh": "API —— Inference Toolkit 说明",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f7241c9ffb37b63",
      "translationZh": "我们基于 transformers 的 pipelines 设计了一套 API，让你轻松用上 pipelines 的全部特性。该 API 的接口与 🤗 Accelerated Inference API 相似：输入需要放在 inputs 键中，如果想使用其他受支持的 pipelines 参数，可以放进 parameters 键。下面是请求示例。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a8c5b735b8291fcd",
      "translationZh": "入门 🧭",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1fddf50a54a97e0",
      "translationZh": "在本指南中，我们将使用新的 Hugging Face 推理 DLC 和 Amazon SageMaker Python SDK 部署两个 transformer 模型进行推理。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3c8e522c99a01ef",
      "translationZh": "第一个示例部署一个在 Amazon SageMaker 中训练的 Hugging Face Transformer 模型进行推理。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6715419e45d0723f",
      "translationZh": "第二个示例直接把 Model Hub 上 10,000 多个公开 Hugging Face Transformers 模型之一部署到 Amazon SageMaker 进行推理。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2d15e1e1017c48ea",
      "translationZh": "搭建环境",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ddcc1bdb8045f10e",
      "translationZh": "示例将使用 Amazon SageMaker Notebook Instance。如何创建 Notebook Instance 可参见这里。开始时，进入你的 Jupyter Notebook 或 JupyterLab，用 conda_pytorch_p36 内核新建一个 Notebook。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c38ee602aa1b3853",
      "translationZh": "注意：Jupyter 并非必需——只要装有 SDK、能连云并有相应权限，我们也可以从任何地方发起 SageMaker API 调用，比如笔记本、其他 IDE，或 Airflow、AWS Step Functions 这类任务调度器。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2170dae20cf2e9d",
      "translationZh": "之后安装所需依赖。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8feeeaa0ad8ca84e",
      "translationZh": "要在 SageMaker 上部署模型，需要创建 sagemaker Session，并提供一个具备正确权限的 IAM 角色。SageMaker SDK 提供了 get_execution_role 方法作为可选的便利工具；你也可以直接写入希望端点使用的具体角色 ARN 来指定角色。这个 IAM 角色稍后会挂到端点上，例如用于从 Amazon S3 下载模型。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2f5075b8375831a4",
      "translationZh": "把训练好的 Hugging Face Transformer 模型部署到 SageMaker 进行推理",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "330224d74154172d",
      "translationZh": "部署你在 SageMaker 训练的 Hugging Face 模型有两种方式：可以在训练结束后立即部署，也可以稍后部署，用 model_data 指向保存在 Amazon S3 上的模型。除下述两种方式外，你还可以用更低层的 SDK（如 boto3、AWS CLI）、Terraform 或 CloudFormation 模板来创建 Hugging Face 端点。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b9fb31425c9a52cc",
      "translationZh": "训练完成后用 Estimator 类直接部署",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "916b1e1790aa87e6",
      "translationZh": "如果训练后直接部署，需确保训练脚本已保存全部所需的模型工件，包括 tokenizer 和模型。直接部署的一个好处是：SageMaker 模型容器元数据会包含来源训练任务，从而提供从训练任务到已部署模型的血缘关系。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7fefbbad0ba57d9",
      "translationZh": "请求跑完后，可以用下面的代码删除端点。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bec9ee23d6a7eb06",
      "translationZh": "用 HuggingFaceModel 类从预训练检查点部署模型",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0aa868b6907a1e4",
      "translationZh": "如果模型已经训练好、想稍后部署，可以用 model_data 参数指定 tokenizer 和模型权重的位置。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50df846cfdbc91fa",
      "translationZh": "请求跑完后，可以用下面的代码删除端点：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b7fef03ca6ccc710",
      "translationZh": "把 10,000 多个 Hugging Face Transformers 之一部署到 Amazon SageMaker 进行推理",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3530c2481a3f75b",
      "translationZh": "要把模型直接从 Hugging Face Model Hub 部署到 Amazon SageMaker，需要在创建 HuggingFaceModel 时定义两个环境变量：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e87a1eede7903ba2",
      "translationZh": "HF_MODEL_ID：定义模型 id，创建 SageMaker 端点时会自动从 huggingface.co/models 加载。🤗 Hub 提供 10,000 多个模型，全部可通过这个环境变量使用。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "438a15bd43049af6",
      "translationZh": "HF_TASK：定义所用 🤗 Transformers pipeline 的任务。完整的任务列表见这里。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7fefbbad0ba57d9",
      "translationZh": "请求跑完后，可以用下面的代码删除端点。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "199032d82ed3d213",
      "translationZh": "常见问题 🎯",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1803e89e821ce95f",
      "translationZh": "完整的常见问题见文档。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d69b692af3ca2a6",
      "translationZh": "问：哪些模型可以部署用于推理？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed7cee9a7e94174d",
      "translationZh": "答：你可以部署：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f807b9dd74ca07a7",
      "translationZh": "任何在 Amazon SageMaker 或其他兼容平台训练、且能适配 SageMaker 托管设计的 🤗 Transformers 模型；",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1e18608b5b0bcdb8",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Model Hub 上 10,000 多个公开 Transformer 模型中的任意一个；或",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4974824f86c3b43e",
      "translationZh": "你托管在 Hugging Face 付费账户里的私有模型！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be403fe0f78c049b",
      "translationZh": "问：Inference Toolkit 支持哪些 pipelines 和任务？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18ae52bc49c7ec3a",
      "translationZh": "答：Inference Toolkit 与 DLC 支持 transformers 的所有 pipelines。完整列表见这里。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33ea8a2801d64577",
      "translationZh": "问：托管 SageMaker 端点时必须使用 transformers pipelines 吗？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8bc0e78f149aeaa6",
      "translationZh": "答：不必。你也可以编写自定义推理代码来服务自己的模型与逻辑，文档见这里。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d94f648920d215ee",
      "translationZh": "问：使用 Hugging Face 深度学习容器（DLC）必须用 SageMaker Python SDK 吗？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7aa79764457dd224",
      "translationZh": "答：可以不用 SageMaker Python SDK，改用其他 SDK（如 AWS CLI、boto3 或 CloudFormation）把模型部署到 SageMaker。DLC 也发布在 Amazon ECR 上，可以在任意环境拉取使用。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "119b159389b51b49",
      "translationZh": "问：为什么要用 Hugging Face 深度学习容器？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3909b6a3fbaec33",
      "translationZh": "答：DLC 是经过完整测试、持续维护和优化的深度学习环境，无需安装、配置或运维。尤其是我们的推理 DLC 自带预置的推理服务栈，大幅降低了深度学习服务化的技术门槛。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84ea716fadb18ef3",
      "translationZh": "问：我的数据和代码在 Amazon SageMaker 上如何获得安全保障？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9760cbe7d6476902",
      "translationZh": "答：Amazon SageMaker 提供众多安全机制，包括静态与传输加密、Virtual Private Cloud（VPC）连接，以及身份与访问管理（IAM）。想进一步了解 AWS 云与 Amazon SageMaker 的安全性，可访问 Security in Amazon SageMaker 与 AWS Cloud Security。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02dd9156a1fccfd7",
      "translationZh": "问：我所在的区域可以用吗？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "febc4091209cc23e",
      "translationZh": "答：支持的区域列表请查看 AWS 全球基础设施的区域表。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a5ba43308e9345d",
      "translationZh": "问：这个方案提供付费支持或支持 SLA 吗？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34cc95bdb121cc3a",
      "translationZh": "答：AWS 提供技术支持分级，覆盖 AWS 产品与服务的开发和生产问题——具体与范围请参阅 AWS Support。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b72196f070f24498",
      "translationZh": "如果你有 Hugging Face 社区能回答或从中受益的问题，请发到 Hugging Face 论坛。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cfeb84305bdcbc4",
